CaptainCook4D is released by its authors under the Apache License 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

Changes made to the licensed material: the published 3840x2160 GoPro stream of each of
the 22 recordings listed in task.toml was scaled to 1080p, its audio track was dropped,
and container metadata and chapters were removed. No frames were cut, cropped or
reordered, and no annotation was modified. The transformation is reproducible with
provenance/data_setup/02_prepare_media.sh, and provenance/media_manifest.json records
the publisher's own URL and the SHA256 of the publisher's own object for every file.

The step and error annotations this task derives its answer key from are the same
release's, pinned by commit in provenance/data_setup/01_download_annotations.sh, and are
transformed by provenance/build_gt.py without being edited.
